## Expense Approval Flow — Architectural Plan

**Summary:** When an expense report is submitted in Expensify, the flow automatically evaluates it. Reports below a configurable threshold are auto-approved and reimbursed instantly. Reports above the threshold are routed to a manager via a HITL approval form; the manager approves or rejects, and the employee gets a Slack notification either way.

---

### Flow Diagram

```mermaid
graph LR
    trigger(Expense Report Submitted)
    evalAmount[Evaluate Amount]
    autoApprove{Auto Approvable}
    reimburse[Reimburse Report]
    hitlReview[Manager Review]
    managerDecision{Manager Approved}
    reimburseAfterApproval[Reimburse Report]
    notifyApproved[Notify Employee Approved]
    notifyRejected[Notify Employee Rejected]
    notifyAutoApproved[Notify Employee Auto Approved]
    handleError[Log Error]
    doneAutoApproved(Done Auto Approved)
    doneApproved(Done Approved)
    doneRejected(Done Rejected)
    doneError(Done Error)
    trigger -->|output| evalAmount
    evalAmount -->|success| autoApprove
    evalAmount -->|error| handleError
    autoApprove -->|true| reimburse
    autoApprove -->|false| hitlReview
    reimburse -->|output| notifyAutoApproved
    reimburse -->|error| handleError
    hitlReview -->|outcome-completed| managerDecision
    managerDecision -->|true| reimburseAfterApproval
    managerDecision -->|false| notifyRejected
    reimburseAfterApproval -->|output| notifyApproved
    reimburseAfterApproval -->|error| handleError
    notifyApproved -->|output| doneApproved
    notifyRejected -->|output| doneRejected
    notifyAutoApproved -->|output| doneAutoApproved
    handleError -->|success| doneError
```

