=== AGENT (turn 7) — 34.2s, in=6 out=968, 3 tool calls ===
✅ Done. The `expense-approvers` group is now set on the task. When a flow instance reaches the Manager Review step, it will:

- Send an **email** to every member of `expense-approvers`
- Create an **Action Center task** visible to the group
- The first person in the group to open it and click Approve or Reject completes the task — the others' copies are automatically dismissed

One thing to be aware of: **`expense-approvers` must exist as a group in your Orchestrator tenant** (under Admin → Groups, or synced from your identity provider). If the group name doesn't match exactly at runtime, the task will fail to assign. Worth double-checking the name before deploying.

